TOOL_VERSION: QEMU emulator version 11.1.2
GNU gdb (GDB) 18.1

===== 1. healthy: -s -S 冻结启动，gdb 干净连接并读 PC =====
+ riscv64-elf-gdb -q -nx -batch -ex 'set architecture riscv:rv64' -ex 'target remote :1234' ...
The target architecture is set to "riscv:rv64".
warning: No executable has been specified and target does not support
determining executable automatically.  Try using the "file" command.
0x0000000000001000 in ?? ()
pc             0x1000	0x1000
[Inferior 1 (process 1) detached]
CASE_EXIT healthy=0

===== 2. no-stub: 启动参数不带 -s，1234 无监听，gdb 连接失败 =====
+ riscv64-elf-gdb -q -nx -batch -ex 'set architecture riscv:rv64' -ex 'target remote :1234' ...
The target architecture is set to "riscv:rv64".
could not connect: Operation timed out.
The program has no registers now.
CASE_EXIT no_stub=1

===== 3. port-busy: 第一台占用 1234，第二台 -s 抢端口失败 =====
qemu-system-riscv64: -s: Failed to find an available port: Address already in use
qemu-system-riscv64: -s: gdbstub: couldn't create chardev
CASE_EXIT port_busy=1（第二台 QEMU 因 1234 被占自行退出，gdbstub chardev 创建失败）

===== 4. arch-mismatch: gdb 误设 riscv:rv32 连 rv64 目标，触发 ambiguous 告警 =====
+ riscv64-elf-gdb -q -nx -batch -ex 'set architecture riscv:rv32' -ex 'target remote :1234' ...
The target architecture is set to "riscv:rv32".
warning: Selected architecture riscv:rv32 is ambiguous with reported target architecture riscv:rv64
warning: No executable has been specified and target does not support
determining executable automatically.  Try using the "file" command.
warning: Selected architecture riscv:rv32 is ambiguous with reported target architecture riscv:rv64
0x0000000000001000 in ?? ()
pc             0x1000	0x1000
[Inferior 1 (process 1) detached]
CASE_EXIT arch_mismatch=0（gdb 不断连，但按错误位宽解读，修法是改回 rv64/auto）

全部四组完成：健康连接退出码 0；无 stub 连接失败；端口占用第二台 QEMU 报 chardev 创建失败；架构误配仅告警不断连。
